+# Batch 39 — Step 1 authoring evidence
+
+Run: `advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23`  
+Scope: `qftx-noninvertible-symmetries` and `qftx-noninvertible-symmetries-examples`.
+
+## Scope and plan reconciliation
+
