+---
+id: def-aqft-ising-fusion-data
+kind: definition
+title: "Skeletal Ising fusion-data package"
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
+domain: mathematics
+library: physics
+category: advanced-qft-and-supersymmetry
