+---
+id: lem-aqft-ising-fusion-data-coherence
+kind: lemma
+title: "Coherence of the Ising fusion data"
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
+domain: mathematics
+library: physics
+category: advanced-qft-and-supersymmetry
