+---
+id: pthm-aqft-noninvertible-defect-realization
+kind: physics-theorem
+title: "Finite-lattice realization of the Ising non-invertible defect"
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
